# kk-daily-ai-voice3 — the 04:30 daily generation job (task 0334 R1/R6; kk news verbs since 0369).
#
# 04:30 America/Los_Angeles, the same cadence the voice2 daily run kept. The entry is defined in
# the zone the machine already runs in, so it needs no DST adjustment.
#
# `kk news generate --publish` is the whole job: prepare, curate, script, render, safety, voice,
# cards, variants, the variants-scope safety review and the freeze, then the generation receipt.
# After successful generation, `--publish` launches the after-generate publish window.
# The run directory is <works>/kk-news-generate/<run>; the log below is the tick's own stdout.
#
# Rendered by `kk schedule render kk-daily-ai-voice3 --platform cron --repo <checkout>`;
# kk never edits the operator's crontab. MERGE, never replace:
#
#     crontab -l > /tmp/kk-voice3.cron 2>/dev/null || :
#     kk schedule render kk-daily-ai-voice3 --platform cron --repo "$PWD" >> /tmp/kk-voice3.cron
#     crontab /tmp/kk-voice3.cron
30 4 * * * cd {{repo}} && mkdir -p .works/kk-news-generate && PATH="{{home}}/.bun/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin" TZ=America/Los_Angeles kk news generate --publish >> {{repo}}/.works/kk-news-generate/generation.log 2>&1
